Z||000005||mrfiero||04-28-2001||11:35 PM||||Officially there is no '88 KYB strut, just '84-'87.  However, they will work on your '88......I've used them on several of the Fieros I've owned.  In some instances you must grind out some metal from the slotted hole  (either the strut or the knuckle).  Some '88s won't allow enough adjustment with the KYBs.....not all, but some.  You won't know until you put them on......I believe it's the right one that gives the most trouble.<P>At any rate, the KYB struts will work, but might need some coaxing.  ||||reg||1
